        "Description": "I come to you with a rather disturbing contract 47. Father Padre Francesco, his peons Arnaldo and Angelo have all been involved in a child grooming gang, operating from the church. Worst yet, the elected official of sapeinza has known all about it, hapilly taking bribes from the head of the church. Mayoress Silvia Morando and her head of security Arcangelo must also pay for their crimes.\rThis is a grim assignment 47, but i know i can count on you to eliminate the targets, make it hurt 47.",
